@low_cost_flight_HostAddress = http://localhost:5273

### 1. Ricerca offerte da Roma (FCO)
GET {{low_cost_flight_HostAddress}}/api/flights/search?departureId=FCO
Accept: application/json

### 2. Ricerca offerte da Milano (MXP) con budget massimo di 100 EUR
GET {{low_cost_flight_HostAddress}}/api/flights/search?departureId=MXP&maxPrice=100&currency=EUR
Accept: application/json

### 3. Ricerca con destinazione specifica (es. Parigi CDG)
GET {{low_cost_flight_HostAddress}}/api/flights/search?departureId=FCO&arrivalId=CDG
Accept: application/json

### 4. CRUD: Crea nuova offerta volo (POST)
POST {{low_cost_flight_HostAddress}}/api/flight-deals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departureAirport": "MXP",
  "arrivalAirport": "BCN",
  "nameCity": "Barcellona",
  "country": "Spagna",
  "price": 29.99,
  "averagePrice": 85.00,
  "discountPercentage": 65,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "durationInMinutes": 95,
  "airline": "Ryanair",
  "flightLink": "https://www.ryanair.com",
  "description": "Volo diretto economico per Barcellona",
  "stops": 0
}

### 5. CRUD: Recupera tutte le offerte dal DB (GET)
GET {{low_cost_flight_HostAddress}}/api/flight-deals
Accept: application/json

### 6. CRUD: Recupera offerte con filtri (GET)
GET {{low_cost_flight_HostAddress}}/api/flight-deals?departureAirport=MXP&maxPrice=50
Accept: application/json

### 7. CRUD: Recupera offerta per ID (GET)
GET {{low_cost_flight_HostAddress}}/api/flight-deals/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. CRUD: Aggiorna offerta per ID (PUT)
PUT {{low_cost_flight_HostAddress}}/api/flight-deals/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departureAirport": "MXP",
  "arrivalAirport": "BCN",
  "nameCity": "Barcellona",
  "country": "Spagna",
  "price": 24.99,
  "averagePrice": 85.00,
  "discountPercentage": 70,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "durationInMinutes": 95,
  "airline": "Ryanair",
  "flightLink": "https://www.ryanair.com",
  "description": "Prezzo ulteriormente ribassato!",
  "stops": 0
}

### 9. CRUD: Elimina offerta per ID (DELETE)
DELETE {{low_cost_flight_HostAddress}}/api/flight-deals/1

